# router_am.py - route generation six: a whole-plan router rebuilt from the
# public ladder replays of team ActiveMusyoku (rank 28, 2,701 on 2026-09-02),
# plus the sell-advance rim from router_fam_lead.py. Built 2026-09-03.
#
# WHY. The family schedule under all our previous agents became the field's
# commons on 2026-09-01; by 2026-09-03 the rim agent read 8-30 over its last
# 30 rated games and the team sat at rank 323. Replays of the losses showed
# three plans beating ours by 10-30k a game. This is one of them, harvested
# whole: 47 of their episodes, 35 sharing one opening (>= 0.95 agreement over
# steps 0-71), route-keyed at step 144 (same key 0.98 agreement, cross key
# 0.48). Structurally it is our plan with a heavier late animal operation:
# 212 wool sold after step 400 against our 90.
#
# WHAT. Opening = medoid tape over steps 0-71. At step 72 the first shop picks
# the medoid tape of that first-shop group (steps 72-143). At step 144 the
# exact route key picks its tape when it agrees >= 0.95 with the 72-143
# segment already played; otherwise the first-shop tape carries on. 23 keys,
# 7 first shops. Rim: SELL orders pulled forward up to 6 steps (see
# router_fam_lead.py).
#
# MEASURED (experiments/tapes/run_agents.py, both seats):
#   vs router_fam_lead (live agent), seeds 200-231:   64-0  mean +35,027  worst +7,963
#   vs its own source game as a tape, seeds 200-207:  16-0  +4,790
#   vs dong & shen / kaggle Osaka / Zyy7390 tapes:     16-0 each, +30k to +53k
#   vs Yuan800 (#2) and Renoir Vieira (#24) tapes:     2-14 each, about -10k to -12k
#   8-opponent panel: see docs/ROUTE_GENERATIONS.md.
# The Yuan800 and Renoir whole-plan routers are built and under test; if
# either beats this one it replaces it. This ships first because the slot it
# takes is bleeding.
#
